@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-57 - View Users List

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Users UI" as FE
control "AuthController" as API
control "UsersService" as Service
database "MongoDB: users, role" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-57
FE -> API: GET /auth/users
API -> Service: Execute View Users List
Service -> DB: Read/write users, role
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Danh sách users hiển thị

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập với role admin
Post: Danh sách users hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin vào /admin/users
2. System gọi API GET /auth/users
3. System trả về: username, email, fullName, role, createdAt, isActive
end note
@enduml
